type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/commits/ddd1e42a035bfa83d751b6ed1880da4ed58eb194/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-19T08:53:15Z","email":"lynxconsulting.africa@gmail.com","name":"lynxsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-19T08:53:15Z","email":"lynxconsulting.africa@gmail.com","name":"lynxsa"},"message":"fix: Resolve course page errors and improve data handling\n\n- Fixed ''Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''reduce'')'' error in course detail page\n- Added proper null/undefined checking with optional chaining (?.) for course properties\n- Created adaptCourseData() function to handle data structure differences between API and local data\n- Fixed ''module.lessons.filter is not a function'' error with proper array checking\n- Added fallback UI components when course modules or lessons are not available\n- Improved error handling for missing course properties (students, instructor, level)\n- Updated component to work with both mock course data and actual course data from data.ts\n- Enhanced course detail page stability and user experience\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Systematic use of optional chaining for safe property access\n- Array.isArray() checks before calling array methods\n- Comprehensive fallback values for all calculations\n- Proper data structure adaptation between different course data formats","tree":{"sha":"70a748ebc4de7d16adeda26b0249002b0a2cb6d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/trees/70a748ebc4de7d16adeda26b0249002b0a2cb6d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/commits/ddd1e42a035bfa83d751b6ed1880da4ed58eb194","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215211469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/events{/privacy}","fo