ude role=TEACHER&userId=teacherId parameters\n- Teachers see only their assigned classes and students\n- Live data display with proper statistics\n- Modern UI with consistent ModernTable components\n\n📊 TESTED RESULTS:\n- Teacher sees 295 students (filtered from 1450)\n- Teacher sees 1014 results (filtered from 9014)\n- Teacher sees 6 assignments (filtered from 505)\n- Teacher sees 33 attendance records (filtered)\n- Teacher sees 5 exams (filtered from 500)\n- Teacher sees 12 events (filtered)\n\n🚀 FEATURES:\n- Authentication redirects for unauthorized access\n- Loading states during data fetch\n- Error handling with retry buttons\n- Statistics cards showing filtered counts\n- Search functionality within filtered data\n- Consistent dark/light theme support\n\nStatus: All admin dashboard pages now properly implement role-based access control","tree":{"sha":"b74ca32a18988782646864f9b272d7b9e1346330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/trees/b74ca32a18988782646864f9b272d7b9e1346330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/commits/e49c84a61a2c3d3cf8bd14e3bc25e9b6e52c90fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215211469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lynxsa","id":215211469,"login":"lynxsa","node_id":"U_kgDODNPdzQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_