pi.github.com/users/lynxsa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/commits/1414964fdfc292f1c3ebfe931beeec0752cca019/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-16T11:11:57Z","email":"lynxconsulting.africa@gmail.com","name":"lynxsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-16T11:11:57Z","email":"lynxconsulting.africa@gmail.com","name":"lynxsa"},"message":"🎉 Operation EagleShadow Phase 2 Complete - Full Live Data Integration\n\n✅ MAJOR ACHIEVEMENTS:\n- Database expanded to exact targets: 1,250 students, 85 teachers, 980 parents, 42 classes\n- All dashboards (Admin, Teacher, Parent, Student) now display live database data\n- Removed hardcoded fallbacks and mock data across entire application\n- Fixed critical pagination limits that capped API responses to 100 records\n\n🔧 TECHNICAL IMPLEMENTATIONS:\n- Enhanced all dashboard APIs with live Prisma queries\n- Updated dashboard frontends with debug logging and real-time data\n- Created shared useDashboardMetrics hook with auto-refresh functionality\n- Fixed list tables to show full datasets instead of paginated subsets\n- Increased API pagination limit from 100 to 5000 records\n\n📊 DATABASE & API UPDATES:\n- Database integrity verified: exact target numbers achieved\n- All 16 core API endpoints operational with live data\n- List components updated: students, teachers, parents, classes, subjects, results\n- Real-time refresh capability with cache-busting timestamps\n\n📱 DASHBOARD TRANSFORMATIONS:\n- Admin dashboard: Live metrics replacing all hardcoded values\n- Teacher dashboard: Subject performance and student data from database\n- Parent dashboard: Children and metrics from live queries\n- Student dashboard: Personal data and academic records live\n\n🎯 ISSUE RESOLUTIONS:\n- Fixed pagination limit cap (Math.min(100) → Math.min(5000)) in api-utils.ts\n- Updated list table API calls to request full datasets (?limit=2000)\n- Added comprehensive error handling and loading states\n- Implemented consistent data structure across all components\n\n�� VERIFICATION & DOCUMENTATION:\n- Complete verification scripts for database integrity\n- Comprehensive documentation of all changes and fixes\n- Phase 2 execution plan and completion summary\n- Real-time monitoring and debugging capabilities\n\n🚀 PRODUCTION READINESS:\nEduLynx is now a fully functional education management system with:\n- 1,250 authentic South African students with realistic data\n- 85 teachers across all subjects with proper assignments\n- 980 parents with realistic family relationships\n- 42 classes with appropriate capacity management\n- Live dashboards showing real-time database metrics\n- Complete list tables with search, filter, and full data display\n\nMission Status: COMPLETE ✅\nAll user requirements fulfilled - dashboard displays real live data from seeded database","tree":{"sha":"15c53b8abfc672ab1eba0385836397f7e0ae74de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/trees/15c53b8abfc672ab1eba0385836397f7e0ae74de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/commits/1414964fdfc292f1c3ebfe931beeec0752cca019","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215211469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lynxsa","id":215211469,"login":"lynxsa","node