or all roles\n- Added Suspense boundaries for better loading states\n- Optimized loading components with memoization\n\n�� PWA & SEO ENHANCEMENTS:\n- Added manifest.json for Progressive Web App support\n- Created sitemap.ts and robots.ts for better SEO\n- Enhanced metadata with proper viewport and social tags\n- Added security headers and performance optimizations\n\n🎨 UI/UX IMPROVEMENTS:\n- Enhanced sign-in card with larger, more accessible design\n- Implemented theme-based logo switching with forceWhiteLogo prop\n- White logo now always displays in purple background boxes\n- Improved loading screens across all applications\n\n🏗️ ARCHITECTURE IMPROVEMENTS:\n- Standardized loading components across the application\n- Better error boundaries and fallback handling\n- Optimized component structure for SSR compatibility\n- Added proper TypeScript interfaces and memo optimizations\n\n📊 SYSTEM READY FOR PRODUCTION:\n- All builds pass successfully\n- TypeScript errors resolved\n- Performance optimized for faster loading\n- Clean, maintainable codebase structure\n- Ready for GitHub deployment\n\nBy LYNX Consulting South Africa (Pty) Ltd","tree":{"sha":"399de6e583c9bb6cfe5195f23a8172a2d7b0b44b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/trees/399de6e583c9bb6cfe5195f23a8172a2d7b0b44b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/commits/c1467f42414b359f3cea9842800b6e4e147f69d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215211469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lynxsa","id":215211469,"login":"lynxsa","node_id":"U_kgDODNPdzQ","organizat