06-18T12:04:45Z","email":"lynxconsulting.africa@gmail.com","name":"lynxsa"},"message":"🐳 Add comprehensive Docker setup and database configuration\n\n✅ Docker Configuration:\n- Added docker-compose.yml for production setup\n- Added docker-compose.dev.yml for development\n- Created PostgreSQL initialization scripts\n- Added Redis support for caching\n\n✅ Database Setup:\n- Configured PostgreSQL connection with existing container\n- Updated Prisma schema back to PostgreSQL\n- Fixed array field compatibility\n- Connected to running lynxacademydb container\n\n✅ Development Tools:\n- Created docker-helper.sh script for easy container management\n- Added comprehensive DOCKER_SETUP.md guide\n- Configured Adminer for database GUI access\n- Added health checks and volume management\n\n✅ Environment Configuration:\n- Updated .env to use PostgreSQL container\n- Added proper connection strings\n- Configured JWT secrets and environment variables\n\n✅ Testing & Verification:\n- Verified database connection works\n- Confirmed existing demo users (248 users found)\n- Started development server successfully\n- Application accessible at localhost:3000\n\n🎯 Key Features:\n- Easy container management with helper script\n- Development and production configurations\n- Database GUI access via Adminer\n- Health monitoring and logging\n- Volume persistence for data safety\n\nDocker is now properly configured and your EduLynx app has full database access! 🎉","tree":{"sha":"1310b3382064960063f3ce252a43492201f985d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/trees/1310b3382064960063f3ce252a43492201f985d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lynxsa/EduLynx/git/commits/3f595bcc327f58f52e6b316830078426c95f68f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215211469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lynxsa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http