177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commit/dde201248ab28ed8a6720d8e0ada3fa5c45a4962","node_id":"C_kwDOO9OE3NoAKGRkZTIwMTI0OGFiMjhlZDhhNjcyMGQ4ZTBhZGEzZmE1YzQ1YTQ5NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commit/b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371","sha":"b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371"}],"sha":"dde201248ab28ed8a6720d8e0ada3fa5c45a4962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/dde201248ab28ed8a6720d8e0ada3fa5c45a4962"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43519177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-19T02:57:28Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-19T02:57:28Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"message":"feat(shell): Implement full UI vision and fix core lifecycle bugs\n\nThis major update transforms the shell from a basic proof-of-concept into a visually rich and robust application that aligns with the vision of a \"web of apps\" with a central auth portal. It also addresses several critical bugs related to data synchronization and component lifecycle.\n\nKey Feature Enhancements:\n- **Visual Overhaul:** Implemented a modern, \"glassmorphism\" UI with a dynamic, animated background to create an immersive shell environment.\n- **Auth Portal Flow:** The app list is now divided into \"Public Apps\" and a \"Secure Portal.\"\n  - Secure apps are visually locked and disabled until the user is authenticated.\n  - A simulated auth flow is now in place: using the \"User Registration\" spore now acts as a login, setting a `currentUser` and unlocking the secure portal.\n- **Enhanced UX:**\n  - Spore cards now include icons for better visual identification.\n  - The header and layout have been polished for a cleaner look and feel.\n  - The user''s logged-in status is clearly displayed.\n\nCritical Bug Fixes:\n- **Data Duplication:** Fixed a race condition where multiple clients would create duplicate \"Host User\" entries in the shared `Y.js` array. Initialization logic now waits for the `websocketProvider` to fire its `sync` event, ensuring the user list is only populated if it''s truly empty on the network.\n- **Spore Reloading:** Resolved a critical lifecycle issue where spores could only be loaded once. The shell now manages the entire \"unmount\" process itself by:\n  1.  Removing the spore''s old `<script>` tag from the DOM on launch.\n  2.  Deleting the spore''s global variable (`window[spore.globalVar]`) to destroy the old module state.\n  3.  Reloading the script from scratch on every launch, guaranteeing a clean re-initialization.","tree":{"sha":"1f2d0c22d8b8386289f855778bffe8a9162dda55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/git/trees/1f2d0c22d8b8386289f855778bffe8a9162dda55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/git/commits/b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43519177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commit/b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371","node_id":"C_kwDOO9OE3NoAKGI4ZmY3NDVkMjI0NTg1Nzg4NzdiMTJkOGRiNzUyMDIxYzViNzYzNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commit/f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434","sha":"f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434"}],"sha":"b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/b8ff745d22458578877b12d8db752021c5b76371"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43519177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-18T16:51:03Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-18T16:51:03Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"message":"feat(framework): Implement Mycelial-Naver routing system\n\nThis commit refactors the MycelialShell from a simple container into a sophisticated Single-Page Application (SPA) router, establishing the core of the \"Mycelial-Naver\" framework.\n\nThe previous architecture loaded all discovered spores at once. This new implementation loads spores on demand based on navigation actions, creating a true user journey and the foundation for a \"web of apps.\"\n\nKey Architectural Changes:\n\n- **Naver Service:** The core logic in `App.vue` has been refactored into a `navigateTo` function. This service acts as the central router, responsible for unmounting old spores and mounting new ones into a single `<router-view>`-style host element.\n\n- **Trail Manifest:** A new `src/naver.js` file was created to act as the \"Trail Manifest.\" This routing table maps URL-like paths (e.g., `/` or `/register`) to specific spore configurations, decoupling the navigation logic from the spore implementation details.\n\n- **NAVIGATE Action:** A new `''NAVIGATE''` action type has been added to the Shell''s `dispatch` handler. Spores no longer have any direct knowledge of routing; they simply dispatch a `NAVIGATE` action with a target path to signal their intent.\n\n- **Browser History API Integration:**\n    - The `navigateTo` function now uses `window.history.pushState()` to update the browser''s URL, creating unique, shareable links for each view.\n    - An event listener for `popstate` has been added, making the browser''s back and forward buttons fully functional within the application.\n    - The Shell now correctly reads the initial URL path on startup to load the appropriate trail, allowing for deep linking.\n\n- **Spore Upgrades:** Both `spore-user-registration` and `spore-current-user` have been updated to use the new navigation system, dispatching `''NAVIGATE''` actions to move between views.","tree":{"sha":"3a0679e70853ca9437f75a83b893c9119d848068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/git/trees/3a0679e70853ca9437f75a83b893c9119d848068"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/git/commits/f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43519177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commit/f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434","node_id":"C_kwDOO9OE3NoAKGY4MTQzMDFkMDlhNzBkZjA2OWIwNDVmNzY4ZjQwMGNjZjkxYTQ0MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commit/678d0d1998c26301a5a85d7af6f5d3392702e8be","sha":"678d0d1998c26301a5a85d7af6f5d3392702e8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/678d0d1998c26301a5a85d7af6f5d3392702e8be"}],"sha":"f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/f814301d09a70df069b045f768f400ccf91a4434"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43519177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/commits/678d0d1998c26301a5a85d7af6f5d3392702e8be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-18T02:17:08Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-18T02:17:08Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"message":"feat(shell): Implement host registration for federated discovery\n\nThis commit updates the Vite configuration for the MycelialShell to enable it to participate in the federated discovery process.\n\nA custom Vite plugin, `registerHostPlugin`, has been added. This plugin automatically sends a `POST` request to the `/register-host` endpoint of the `mycelial-rendezvous` server upon startup of the dev server.\n\nThis announcement includes the host''s unique name (`MycelialShell-A`) and a URL to its public `manifest.json` file. This is the crucial first step in allowing other Shells to discover this host and the public spores it offers, laying the foundation for a true \"web of apps.\"","tree":{"sha":"156b1dcaf4b5f63f7eb11e6d198920adb3ec20cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/git/trees/156b1dcaf4b5f63f7eb11e6d198920adb3ec20cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-shell/git/commits/678d0d1998c26301a5a85d7af6f5d3392702e8be","verificati