red{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commits/a7b1c5ced04dba3b4e8d9f23e92e4b6fed6d664e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-27T20:54:17Z","email":"angela.gomba@instructure.com","name":"Angela Gomba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-09T15:23:48Z","email":"angela.gomba@instructure.com","name":"Angela Gomba"},"message":"Add Convert Tag Overrides to Edit Pages\n\ncloses EGG-1262\nflag=assign_to_differentiation_tags\n\n[fsc-timeout=75]\n[fsc-node-count=18]\n[fsc-max-nodes=18]\n\nTest Plan:\n- Enable the Differentiation Tag setting in your account\n- In a course within that account, create at least 1 diff tag\n  with a student assigned to it\n- Create an assignment, discussion, classic quiz, and wiki page\n  and assign each to the diff tag\n- Disable the Differentiation Tag setting in your account\n- Go to the edit page for each learning object and verify\n  you see the convert overrides message\n- Turn on Voice Over\n- Navigate to the Save button and click it\n- Observe the focus is brought to the convert button in the\n  alert and the alert message is read\n- Click the button to convert the override\n- Observe the override is converted and the assign to section\n  reloads to reflect the converted override\n- Save the learning object and observe it saves successfully\n\nChange-Id: I0cea96abf28e136e25f9ec59891fd0026fc28ecc\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/379436\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Sam Garza <sam.garza@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"113d4aa56383e2f8651e2cdb04afe7bf7aeeede1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/trees/113d4aa56383e2f8651e2cdb04afe7bf7aeeede1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/commits/a7b1c5ced04dba3b4e8d9f23e92e4b6fed6d664e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33700893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelagomba","id":33700893,"login":"angelagomba","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAwODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commit/a7b1c5ced04dba3b4e8d9f23e92e4b6fed6d664e","node_id":"C_kwDOO9V729oAKGE3YjFjNWNlZDA0ZGJhM2I0ZThkOWYyM2U5MmU0YjZmZWQ2ZDY2NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commit/b93ff18ab6633ab7a68dc3eba53040c95ba71e00","sha":"b93ff18ab6633ab7a68dc3eba53040c95ba71e00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commits/b93ff18ab6633ab7a68dc3eba53040c95ba71e00"}],"sha":"a7b1c5ced04dba3b4e8d9f23e92e4b6fed6d664e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commits/a7b1c5ced04dba3b4e8d9f23e92e4b6fed6d664e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf","id":122654,"login":"aaronshaf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjY1NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commits/b93ff18ab6633ab7a68dc3eba53040c95ba71e00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-08T00:12:03Z","email":"ashafovaloff@instructure.com","name":"Aaron Shafovaloff"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-09T15:20:11Z","email":"ckline@instructure.com","name":"Charley Kline"},"message":"Fix language pack loading (solution 1)\n\nWhen assignment_edit was migrated from js_bundle to React Router lazy loading,\na race condition was introduced where React Router components could render\nbefore I18n translations were loaded, causing inconsistent language display.\n\nThis fix ensures loadReactRouter() only executes after the I18n capability\nis ready, maintaining the same loading order as the previous bundle system.\n\nTest plan:\n- Set course language to Russian or Ukrainian\n- Navigate to assignment edit pages\n- Verify all UI elements are properly translated\n- Clear cache and reload to ensure consistency\n- Test with slow network to verify translations load before rendering\n\nChange-Id: I9e1e93e3522852355d34390d91b920f428fa8b29\nReview