-06T12:06:41Z","email":"bence.arpasi@instructure.com","name":"Bence Árpási"},"message":"Ignore Extra fields for Asset Processor Services\n\nWhen a tool is sending a request to the Asset Processor services we\nshould silently ignore any extra fields.\n\ncloses INTEROP-9411\n\nflag=lti_asset_processor\n\ntest plan\n- Send a Report to the Asset Report Service with extra fields included\n- Report should be created\n\nChange-Id: If9e698a9f97ce37cb981855921f68b7a27c9db09\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/380044\nReviewed-by: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Steven McGee <steve.mcgee@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Bence Árpási <bence.arpasi@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"44913c1e5fd2b012d425944bc12361c9e18ce141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/trees/44913c1e5fd2b012d425944bc12361c9e18ce141"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/commits/c1fb4eb09624e4b1d2c74add69240c77a63d347b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/553442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abence","id":553442,"login":"abence","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u