ure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-instructure","id":153002962,"login":"jason-instructure","node_id":"U_kgDOCR6j0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commits/4759926ed01e4f3fc789aa48fe007db60f68ad17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-15T15:33:43Z","email":"jason.anderson@instructure.com","name":"Jason Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-05T22:19:53Z","email":"jason.anderson@instructure.com","name":"Jason Anderson"},"message":"Convert Tags for Checkpoints\n\ncloses EGG-1183\nflag=assign_to_differentiation_tags\n\n[fsc-timeout=60]\n[fsc-node-count=10]\n[fsc-max-nodes=10]\n\nThis adds a new converter to the differentiation\ntag converter service in Canvas. This properly\nhandles checkpointed discussions and ensures\nstudents get the correct dates\n\nTest Plan:\n- Create a checkpointed discussion in a course\n- Add some diff tag overrides to it\n- Disable the account setting for diff tags\n- In the \"Assign To\" tray for the discussion\n  - Select the \"Convert Tags\" button in the warning\n    box\n  - Verify that students are placed in the correct\n    overrides\n  - If a student already has an AHDOC override then\n    nothing is created for that student\n  - Students are given the latest possible dates\n    for reply_to_topic and reply_to_entry\n\nChange-Id: Ia617ce041b4009e8abbca3519bdf0d1963495033\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/379580\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Martin Yosifov <martin.yosifov@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Martin Yosifov <martin.yosifov@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Kyle Rosenbaum <krosenbaum@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0ff382daf5fa62452498992bab06a38486df626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/trees/b0ff382daf5fa62452498992bab06a38486df626"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/commits/4759926ed01e4f3fc789aa48fe007db60f68ad17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153002962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-instructure","id":153002962,"login":"jason-instructure","node_id":"U_kgDOCR6j0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commit/4759926ed01e4f3fc789aa48fe007db60f68ad17","node_id":"C_kwDOO9V729oAKD