url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipeleoninstructure","id":201780020,"login":"felipeleoninstructure","node_id":"U_kgDODAbrNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/commits/98efdf73ea962a1d6c34e4be422c305c5d0e5072/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-03T20:35:58Z","email":"felipe.leon@instructure.com","name":"Felipe Leon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-05T19:02:17Z","email":"felipe.leon@instructure.com","name":"Felipe Leon"},"message":"Add tool tip to \"In Progress\" (circle) icon for module items\n\nWhen completion requirements have been set for a module, the\nempty circle must be shown and when hover it a tool tip with the\ncompletion message must be shown.\n\nTest Plan:\n\n1. Turn on flag modules_page_rewrite_student_view\n2. Create a Course with more than 1 module and with several\n    items in each module.\n3. Configure completion requirements for the module using the\n    assignments. Configure at least one for each completion\n    requirement type.\n4. Add a Student to the course\n5. Act as a Student in the course\n6. Go to Modules section\n7. Check the module items list in the module.\n    Verify:\n        Empty circle is shown when the requirement have not been\n        met yet.\n        When passing the cursor over the circle the tooltip must\n        be shown with the right message. The arrow of the tooltip\n        must be pointing to the assignment, not to the circle (as\n        in old modules ui).\n\nflag=modules_page_rewrite_student_view\nCloses: LX-2753\n\nChange-Id: I05593fef5df23ba1c77e96f9bfe4703984b30ab5\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/380097\nReviewed-by: Ed Schiebel <eschiebel@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Ed Schiebel <eschiebel@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Zoe Lubitz <zoe.lubitz@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b16ff46a0f3a816e97b8f3c4fe383de2e999830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/trees/3b16ff46a0f3a816e97b8f3c4fe383de2e999830"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rishabhchheda01/canvas-lms/git/commits/98efdf73ea962a1d6c34e4be422c305c5d0e5072","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201780020?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipeleoninstructure","id":201780020,"login":"felipeleoninstructure","node_id":"U_kgDODAbrNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipeleoninstructur