ps://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TyNorth","id":43519177,"login":"TyNorth","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTE5MTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TyNorth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-rendevous/commits/8e0c796cad1ba2a25a7407f45431c1dd0392ad32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-18T02:16:56Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-18T02:16:56Z","email":"north.tyronejr@gmail.com","name":"TylerNorth"},"message":"feat(shell): Implement host registration for federated discovery\n\nThis commit updates the Vite configuration for the MycelialShell to enable it to participate in the federated discovery process.\n\nA custom Vite plugin, `registerHostPlugin`, has been added. This plugin automatically sends a `POST` request to the `/register-host` endpoint of the `mycelial-rendezvous` server upon startup of the dev server.\n\nThis announcement includes the host''s unique name (`MycelialShell-A`) and a URL to its public `manifest.json` file. This is the crucial first step in allowing other Shells to discover this host and the public spores it offers, laying the foundation for a true \"web of apps.\"","tree":{"sha":"f73177a2942ac5ae1a16bd01c3c5e9901a2919dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-rendevous/git/trees/f73177a2942ac5ae1a16bd01c3c5e9901a2919dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TyNorth/mycelial-rendevous/git/commits/8e0c796cad1ba2a25a7407f45431c1dd0392ad32","verification":{"payload":nu